mcp_docs_setup_content:
=== Hermes Agent ===
Config: ~/.hermes/config.yaml

mcp_servers:
  paap-mcp:
    url: http://127.0.0.1:9090/mcp/message
    enabled: true

Restart Hermes setelah edit config.

=== Claude Code ===
Config: ~/.claude/settings.json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "paap": {
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9090/mcp/message",
      "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_GATEWAY_KEY" }
    }
  }
}

=== OpenCode ===
Config: ~/.config/opencode/config.json
{
  "mcp": {
    "servers": {
      "paap": {
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9090/mcp/message",
        "auth": "Bearer YOUR_GATEWAY_KEY"
      }
    }
  }
}

=== Cursor ===
Config: ~/.cursor/mcp.json
Format header autentikasi sama seperti Claude Code.

=== Windsurf ===
Config: ~/.windsurf/mcp.json
Format sama seperti Cursor.
